  "agent": "epic",
  "note": "The “hair” motif (MBh 1.189.31; ViP 5.1.60; BhP 2.7.26) and the Bhāgavata’s “bhagavān svayam” (1.3.28) are the textual poles of the later debate on whether Kṛṣṇa is an avatāra of Viṣṇu or their source (Gauḍīya view). See Matchett 2001."
