 {
  "id": "cmp:rama-story-vr-vs-ramopakhyana",
  "title": "The Rāma story in Vālmīki and in the Mahābhārata’s Rāmopākhyāna",
  "subject": "char:rama",
  "question": "Which parts of the Rāma story does each version tell, and how do they differ?",
  "rows": [
   {
    "text": "text:valmiki-ramayana",
    "locator": "VR (CE) 1–7",
    "statement": "Seven books: frame with Vālmīki, Nārada and the krauñca (1.1–4); births as portions of Viṣṇu (1.17); Viśvāmitra, Tāṭakā, Ahalyā, the bow and the four weddings (1.24–72); Paraśurāma (1.73–75); exile (Book 2); abduction (3.40–49); vānara alliance and Vālin (Book 4); Hanumān in Laṅkā (Book 5); war, fire ordeal and Brahmā’s hymn (6.103–106); consecration (6.116); Rāvaṇa’s back-story, Hanumān’s childhood, banishment, Śambūka, the twins and Sītā’s return to the earth (Book 7).",
    "sources": [
     {
      "source": "src:gretil-vr-ce",
      "locator": "VR (CE) 1.1–7.100",
      "edition": "Baroda Critical Edition (GRETIL e-text)",
      "url": "https://gretil.sub.uni-goettingen.de/gretil/corpustei/transformations/plaintext/sa_rAmAyaNa.txt"
     },
     {
      "source": "src:goldman-vr",
      "locator": "vols. 1–7"
     }
    ],
    "status": "verified-online"
   },
   {
    "text": "text:ramopakhyana",
    "locator": "MBh (CE) 3.257–275",
    "statement": "Told by Mārkaṇḍeya to console Yudhiṣṭhira. Opens with Rāvaṇa’s Paulastya genealogy and boon (3.258–259); Brahmā says Viṣṇu has descended and has the gods beget monkey allies, and sends the gandharvī Dundubhī as Mantharā (3.260). Omits the Viśvāmitra episodes, Ahalyā, the bow contest and the marriages (Sītā is simply Janaka’s daughter made by Tvaṣṭṛ, 3.258.9); compresses the exile; Lakṣmaṇa kills Kumbhakarṇa (3.271.16) and Indrajit (3.273); after Rāvaṇa’s death Sītā is vindicated by divine testimony without a fire-entry (3.275.10–36). No Uttarakāṇḍa material: no banishment, no twins.",
    "sources": [
     {
      "source": "src:gretil-mbh-ce",
      "locator": "MBh (CE) 3.257–275",
      "edition": "BORI Critical Edition (GRETIL e-text)",
      "url": "https://gretil.sub.uni-goettingen.de/gretil/1_sanskr/2_epic/mbh/mbh_03_u.htm"
     },
     {
      "source": "src:gretil-mbh-ce",
      "locator": "MBh (CE) 3.258.9",
      "edition": "BORI Critical Edition (GRETIL e-text)",
      "url": "https://gretil.sub.uni-goettingen.de/gretil/1_sanskr/2_epic/mbh/mbh_03_u.htm"
     },
     {
      "source": "src:gretil-mbh-ce",
      "locator": "MBh (CE) 3.260.5–15",
      "edition": "BORI Critical Edition (GRETIL e-text)",
      "url": "https://gretil.sub.uni-goettingen.de/gretil/1_sanskr/2_epic/mbh/mbh_03_u.htm"
     },
     {
      "source": "src:gretil-mbh-ce",
      "locator": "MBh (CE) 3.271.16",
      "edition": "BORI Critical Edition (GRETIL e-text)",
      "url": "https://gretil.sub.uni-goettingen.de/gretil/1_sanskr/2_epic/mbh/mbh_03_u.htm"
     },
     {
      "source": "src:gretil-mbh-ce",
      "locator": "MBh (CE) 3.275.10–36",
      "edition": "BORI Critical Edition (GRETIL e-text)",
      "url": "https://gretil.sub.uni-goettingen.de/gretil/1_sanskr/2_epic/mbh/mbh_03_u.htm"
     }
    ],
    "status": "verified-online"
   }
  ],
  "agent": "epic",
  "note": "Whether the Rāmopākhyāna abridges Vālmīki (majority view) or preserves an older/independent telling is unresolved; see assertion text:ramopakhyana DERIVED_FROM text:valmiki-ramayana."
 },
 {
  "id": "cmp:sita-birth",
  "title": "Sītā’s birth",
